    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Exactly what it says on the tin; <strong>Hook-a-duck</strong>, in <strong>VR</strong>!<br><br>Ever played the game where you catch rubber ducks with a rudimentary plastic fishing rod? possibly. What about the version where some of the ducks had outboard motors attached to their rear-end and can actually &quot;fly&quot;? unlikely. What about the even rarer variant where some of the ducks are invisible? impossible.<br><br>Hook-a-Duck VR is a simple VR interpretation of the classic fairground stalwart, with a few extra <strong>spicy additions</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple gamemodes!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Simon Says:</strong> Catch only the ducks &quot;Simon&quot; (in this case a PC monitor) asks you to catch!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>This or That:</strong> Put the ducks in the bucket that matches the sentence! If the sentence is &quot;____ for dead&quot;, put it in the bucket that says &quot;Left&quot;!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Score attack and more:</strong> Time limit and score attack modes; catch all the ducks in the time limit &amp; catch as many as you can in the time limit!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Duck variety!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Armed with an outboard motor and a helmet, some ducks can move when they want to!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A novel idea; Some ducks can actually fly!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Some ducks use a cloaking ability to evade capture, although impacts can reveal their position briefly!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Just like us, every Duck is different; some are big, some are small!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Other ducks are happy to be their own, unremarkable selfs. These ducks have no additional abilites at all!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Exactly what it says on the tin; <strong>Hook-a-duck</strong>, in <strong>VR</strong>!<br><br>Ever played the game where you catch rubber ducks with a rudimentary plastic fishing rod? possibly. What about the version where some of the ducks had outboard motors attached to their rear-end and can actually &quot;fly&quot;? unlikely. What about the even rarer variant where some of the ducks are invisible? impossible.<br><br>Hook-a-Duck VR is a simple VR interpretation of the classic fairground stalwart, with a few extra <strong>spicy additions</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple gamemodes!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Simon Says:</strong> Catch only the ducks &quot;Simon&quot; (in this case a PC monitor) asks you to catch!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>This or That:</strong> Put the ducks in the bucket that matches the sentence! If the sentence is &quot;____ for dead&quot;, put it in the bucket that says &quot;Left&quot;!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Score attack and more:</strong> Time limit and score attack modes; catch all the ducks in the time limit &amp; catch as many as you can in the time limit!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Duck variety!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Armed with an outboard motor and a helmet, some ducks can move when they want to!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A novel idea; Some ducks can actually fly!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Some ducks use a cloaking ability to evade capture, although impacts can reveal their position briefly!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Just like us, every Duck is different; some are big, some are small!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Other ducks are happy to be their own, unremarkable selfs. These ducks have no additional abilites at all!</li></ul>",
